A portal implementation (templates, queries, i18n files and static files) can now be loaded from Mesh. When the new configuration option `portalImplementation` (environment variable `PORTAL_IMPLEMENTATION`) is set, the portal downloads the package of the portal implementation with this keyword on startup and whenever it changes. Templates, queries and i18n files replace the files in the configured folders. Static files are extracted into the new folder `static.implementationPath` (environment variable `STATIC_IMPLEMENTATION_PATH`, default `data/implementation/static`) and served in addition to the existing static files; for files with the same path, the portal implementation wins.
With the start-up check mode `UNREADY`, the start-up checks are repeated after each update of the portal implementation, and passing checks make the portal ready again.
